;    1: TDecorate(count=25, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=660, unk2=2960895, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=892, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=みなかみし, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=419, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=27, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=は, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ゆが, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あお, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=3546, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=3220, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>By the time we got to Motoki Police Station, the sun had set completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this is Motoki-cho, where <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> used to live.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> said, it's a beautiful place with lots of cherry trees.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, let's go inside. I have something to give </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"'You' again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Give me a break already..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could he have to give me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm a runaway girl, after all, so I figure at the very least they'll make me fill out some paperwork.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I follow <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> into the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I follow <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> in silence, the officers in the station salute <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He really is somebody important...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\警察署パーテーション.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I expected to be shown to an interrogation room, but it's a space just divided off by partitions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm in full view of everyone else.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
Then <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> goes off somewhere right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can sense people passing by outside the partitions, and if someone wanted to <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="のぞ">peek</STYLE> in here, they could <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="のぞ">peek</STYLE> right in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel even less at ease here than at the police station in <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE>...<PG>
Just then, a woman who seemed to be a clerk came over to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Here you are."
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
she said, and set out some tea for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're even giving me something to drink. What's that about?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry for the wait. I'm lending this to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
What he hands me is an old-model smartphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't quite see the point.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"All right, that's all we need to do here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm calling it a day too, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> head out as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, what does this mean..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's a smartphone I used to use. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It can still make calls, so use it to keep in touch with your parents."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I can leave here already?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> parents asked me to look after you, didn't they?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Since your parents have given permission, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'re no longer a runaway girl, just a traveler. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There's no problem at all with me looking after you personally."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At those words, my face lights up like a flower blooming.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! I'll do my best not to cause you any trouble!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't be so loud... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hurry up and use that phone to contact your parents. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Otherwise they'll end up calling mine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I rushed out of the police station, overjoyed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now then, first I'll call <STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Are you safe!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I told you, I'm with the police, so I'm fine... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Just to make sure, it's okay for a </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">police officer</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to look after me 'personally,' right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> was concerned about the child abduction issue, so I'm checking just to be safe.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, if it's the police, that's reassuring... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But really, make sure you don't become a burden, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know, I know!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">And also..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this point, I think back to the Motoki-cho case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Did </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE> really commit the <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="は">flaying</STYLE> case, take <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> away, and come to the Arata settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm going to find out, it's now or never.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> come to the Arata settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I explained that before, didn't I?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　We wanted more hands in the Arata settlement too, so Daddy asked them."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's... a lie, isn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It's weird, with both of them in the mountain seclusion for years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">police officer</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> who's looking after me is from Motoki-cho."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Motoki-cho!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE> reacts strongly at the name Motoki-cho.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, did </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... kill someone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> don't need to know that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then it's okay if I tell the police about it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">That police officer</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> has been working hard all along to protect the peace of Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So he's worried that if the culprit isn't caught, the peace of Motoki-cho will be destroyed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So if it's to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">him</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'd..."</STYLE><PG>
Of course, this is a threat to get the truth out of him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if <STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE> is the culprit, I have no intention of telling <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But left like this, it'll leave a knot in my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's the only reason.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... if that were so, Daddy and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> would be arrested for harboring a </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">criminal</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Are you okay with that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE> has headed me off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't want <STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="10">Mommy</STYLE> to be arrested.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on... I'm grown up now too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You can tell me the truth, can't you? I won't tell the police..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I say that, I hear a big sigh from the other end of the line.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE> seems to be thinking hard.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'll tell you that once </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'ve come back to the settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If you want to know, make up your mind and come back soon. Got it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE> is very good at this kind of bargaining.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He uses the information I want as bait to get me to come back to the settlement, and keeps the truth hidden for now on top of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can tell from the mood that it's clearly suspicious, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay... I won't go telling the police about what I'm wondering now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">but when I come back, can you get </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to come to Motoki-cho?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I hear there are still people waiting for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to come back safely."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not to be outdone, I try some bargaining of my own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To repay <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>, who's taking the trouble to look after me, even a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'd have to ask </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> about that. I can't really say..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'll call again."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> should have precognition like </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mommy's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Probably, anywhere there are cherry trees, you can foresee danger wherever you are. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Use it and stay safe, you hear?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Me, with a power like that...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I've never felt any danger yet, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If that's the case, that's fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Being with the police is reassuring, but look out for yourself, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know, I know! I'm strong!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even hearing me act tough, <STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE> still seems worried.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When a daughter my age runs away from home, of course he's going to worry.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. I love </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> both. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So once I'm back and my eyes are cured, let's all live happily together again."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But wait just a little longer for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I need just a little more time to prepare myself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"All right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Daddy and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> both love </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you know."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
We wrapped up with that exchange and ended the call.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two things bother me about that call.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE> really does seem suspicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the other, the danger sense.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry for the wait."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
